<title>LITHUANIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>LITHUANIA GOVERNMENT LIST (961127)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 27 Nov 96 - President Brazauskas named Gediminas Vagnorius*</p>
<p> *		 as new prime minister. Vagnorius said he would*</p>
<p> *		 aim to present his new cabinet for parliament *</p>
<p> *		 approval either on Nov 29 or Dec 2.	     *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p> President (Elected 14 Feb 93).............Algirdas BRAZAUSKAS</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 27 Nov 96)..........Gediminas VAGNORIUS</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p>OUTGOING GOVERNMENT (Formed 23 Feb 96):</p>
<p> Prime Minister................Mindaugas Laurinas STANKEVICIUS</p>
<p>(Apptd 8 Feb 96)</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture..................................Vytautas EINORIS</p>
<p> Communications &amp; Information................Vaidotas ABRAITIS</p>
<p> Culture.....................................Juozas NEKROSHIUS</p>
<p> Defence.....................................Linas LINKEVICIUS</p>
<p> Economics...................................Antanas KAMINSKAS</p>
<p> Education &amp; Science......................Vladislavas DOMARKAS</p>
<p> Energy..........................................Saulius KUTAS</p>
<p> Environment Protection, Economy (Acting)...Bronius BRADAUSKAS</p>
<p> Finance..............................Algimantas KRIZHINAUSKAS</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.................................Povilas GYLYS</p>
<p> Forestry................................Albertas VASILIAUSKAS</p>
<p> Government Reforms &amp; Municipal Affairs.........Petras PAPOVAS</p>
<p> Health.........................................Antanas VINKUS</p>
<p> Housing &amp; Urban Development..............Aldona BARANAUSKIENE</p>
<p> Interior...................................Virgilijus BULOVAS</p>
<p> Justice........................................Albertas VALYS</p>
<p> Social Security &amp; Labour....................Mindaugas MIKAILA</p>
<p> Trade &amp; Industry.....................Kazimieras KLIMASHAUSKAS</p>
<p> Transportation................................Jonas BIRZISKIS</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p> Parliament Chairman......................Chesolovas JURSHENAS</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank President..................Reinoldijus SHARKINAS</p>
<p>				- - - - - -</p>
<p>	  NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			 (End Government List)</p>
